    @subsection proj_1_1 proj Module Version 1.1
    - @ref Qore::PROJ::ProjTransformer::transformInverseBatch()
      "transformInverseBatch()" — bulk inverse transform, symmetrical
      with @c transformBatch().
    - @ref Qore::PROJ::great_circle_distance() "great_circle_distance()",
      @ref Qore::PROJ::forward_azimuth() "forward_azimuth()", and
      @ref Qore::PROJ::inverse_azimuth() "inverse_azimuth()" — WGS84
      geodesic helpers wrapping GeographicLib's C API (bundled with
      libproj). Sub-millimetre accuracy globally; no @ref
      Qore::PROJ::ProjTransformer "ProjTransformer" needed.
    - New companion user module @ref ProjGeos "ProjGeos" — transforms
      @c GEOSGeometry coordinates through a @ref
      Qore::PROJ::ProjTransformer "ProjTransformer" without C-level
      coupling between @c module-proj and @c module-geos.

